e sprite count, allowing repeated markers.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/581f7754.py:545:    \"\"\"Build sprites in their solved locations and return their align metadata.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/581f7754.py:564:    \"\"\"Move solved sprites onto the input canvas along the inverse axis.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/581f7754.py:576:    \"\"\"Apply generator invariants and the solver oracle check.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/581f7754.py:582:def generate_input() -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/d8e07eb2.py:28:def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/d8e07eb2.py:29:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/d8e07eb2.py:47:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/d8e07eb2.py:145:    \"\"\"True if the 3x3 bitmask spans all four edges (non-empty top/bottom/left/right rows).\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/d8e07eb2.py:162:    \"\"\"Assign 16 colors (one per cell) so each of the 8 palette colors appears 1-3 times.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/d8e07eb2.py:174:    \"\"\"Pick 16 distinct 3x3 shape masks with a balanced distribution of fill counts.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/d8e07eb2.py:189:    \"\"\"Render a 3x3 bitmask as a CELL x CELL array with 1-pixel border of BG.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/d8e07eb2.py:197:    \"\"\"Pick a complete row or column of 4 cells (shuffled order).\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/d8e07eb2.py:209:    \"\"\"Pick `count` distinct cells that do NOT all share a single row or column.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/d8e07eb2.py:252:    \"\"\"Build the expected solver output by green-filling matched cells and verdict band.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/d8e07eb2.py:267:    \"\"\"Try to generate one valid input grid; return None on oracle mismatch.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/d8e07eb2.py:297:def generate_inpu